# UI Kit (Prokat)

Before creating a new UI widget, search `lib/core/widgets/ui_kit/` **and** `lib/core/widgets/`.

## New screens / widgets

- Buttons → `AppElevatedButton` / `AppOutlinedButton` / `AppTextButton`
- Fields → `AppTextField` / `AppTextArea` / `AppDropdownField` / `AppKzPhoneField`
- Selectors → `AppCheckbox` / `AppRadio` / `AppSwitch`
- Modals → bottom sheets only (`AppBottomSheet.show` / `showScrollable`) via a `*Sheet.show` class — no new `AlertDialog`
- Icons → `AppIcons.*.call(...)`; images → `AppImages.*.call(...)`
- Do not invent `FooButton`, `AuthTextField`, `IndustrialTextField`, or parallel inputs

## Forms

- `TextEditingController` + `Form` / `validator`
- Do **not** port Vipitalia `FormField*` state machines

## Legacy

- Existing screens on `InputField` / `PrimaryButton` / etc. — do not mass-migrate “for free”
- Do not import `package:shared_ui` / `shared_core` / Vipitalia paths
